    "sourceUri": "pdf://MIP-21/proposal.pdf#page=3",
    "page": 3,
    "text": "3. Scope. The upgrade replaces the Vault implementation behind the existing UUPS proxy at 0xa513E6E4b8f2a923D98304ec87F64353C4D5C853. Changes are limited to slot packing and EIP-2929 warm-access savings. The Timelock remains the sole owner of the Vault.",
    "sha256": "0x7e3e2ad20b88a3f9b52900eacb9fcf7cc414287fc08d229a13d5de6e856f8311"
  },
  {
    "id": "MIP-21:pdf:1",
