    "sourceType": "pdf",
    "sourceUri": "pdf://MIP-21/proposal.pdf#page=4",
    "page": 4,
    "text": "4. Benchmarks. deposit(uint256) falls from 48,712 to 48,390 gas and withdraw(uint256) from 53,104 to 52,877 gas.",
